Serve HTTPS and TLS passthrough on a shared port from one Envoy listener in
the per-port translation path, so a Gateway with passthrough on two ports no
longer emits two listeners named listener-<port> (cilium/cilium#48269).

Upstream: cilium/cilium#49248. Drop it once a shipped Cilium release
carries the fix.

